DROP SCHEMA frozen CASCADE;
NOTICE:  drop cascades to 14 other objects
DETAIL:  drop cascades to type frozen.pair
drop cascades to table frozen.scalars
drop cascades to table frozen.composite
drop cascades to table frozen.keyless
drop cascades to table frozen.sent_keys
drop cascades to table frozen.bool_keys
drop cascades to table frozen.special
drop cascades to table frozen.special_n
drop cascades to table frozen.non_ascii
drop cascades to table frozen.large
drop cascades to type frozen.vkey
drop cascades to table frozen.varchar_keys
drop cascades to table frozen.varchar_domain
drop cascades to table frozen.cidr_keys
